    "name": "Hollow Jump",
    "steam_appid": 3744900,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u>Thrilling precision platforming, now easier and more exhilarating than ever!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the same intense and thrilling fun of precision platformers, but without the frustration \u2014 a stylish and refreshing jump action game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use fast and stylish aerial combos and dash actions to dodge monsters and obstacles freely, and climb to the top in your own unique way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break free from fixed routes and repetitive patterns unleash your creativity and strategy to enjoy a fresh and thrilling experience every time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where steampunk and fantasy blend beautifully, feel the exhilarating sense of achievement as you reach the top in your own style!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a harsh and unforgiving world, people dream of something greater something monumental they hope to reach one day. Some say there\u2019s wealth at the summit. Others speak of a utopia that awaits. But the truth is, no one really knows what lies at the end. HollowJump is a quiet yet relentless journey upward, chasing the question itself. You fall again and again and yet, even within the seemingly meaningless repetition, you keep climbing, higher and higher. Toward a destination no one has seen, just one more step upward.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an adventurer in a fantasy steampunk world. Armed with nothing but your ability to jump and dash, you traverse airborne cities, mechanical ruins, and bizarre, living structures inhabited by machine-fused creatures\u2014all in search of the truth. With a dystopian setting, constant tension, tight controls, and a vertically expanding level design, \u300aHollowJump\u300b offers more than just a jump game. It\u2019s a deeply immersive experience that quietly reflects on the essence of life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thought-provoking message exploring the meaning of life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking vertical 2D pixel art maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world fused with flying airships, biomechanical lifeforms, and mysterious mechanical civilizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense, timing-based gameplay focused on evasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision controls with jump strength adjustment, aerial dashes, and rhythmic movement to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple at first, but designed to reveal deeper mechanics the higher you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative told through fragmented world-building and mysterious NPC encounters, waiting for you to piece it together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A profound journey, unfolding through simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the quiet message the world has to offer\u2014firsthand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/f565f1600f792f070c0fd68becc489e6.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong><u>Thrilling precision platforming, now easier and more exhilarating than ever!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience the same intense and thrilling fun of precision platformers, but without the frustration \u2014 a stylish and refreshing jump action game!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use fast and stylish aerial combos and dash actions to dodge monsters and obstacles freely, and climb to the top in your own unique way.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Break free from fixed routes and repetitive patterns unleash your creativity and strategy to enjoy a fresh and thrilling experience every time!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a world where steampunk and fantasy blend beautifully, feel the exhilarating sense of achievement as you reach the top in your own style!</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong></strong><br><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In a harsh and unforgiving world, people dream of something greater something monumental they hope to reach one day. Some say there\u2019s wealth at the summit. Others speak of a utopia that awaits. But the truth is, no one really knows what lies at the end. HollowJump is a quiet yet relentless journey upward, chasing the question itself. You fall again and again and yet, even within the seemingly meaningless repetition, you keep climbing, higher and higher. Toward a destination no one has seen, just one more step upward.</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/a8d37efd3e623fa2147580c831a70294.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Overview </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are an adventurer in a fantasy steampunk world. Armed with nothing but your ability to jump and dash, you traverse airborne cities, mechanical ruins, and bizarre, living structures inhabited by machine-fused creatures\u2014all in search of the truth. With a dystopian setting, constant tension, tight controls, and a vertically expanding level design, \u300aHollowJump\u300b offers more than just a jump game. It\u2019s a deeply immersive experience that quietly reflects on the essence of life itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/18339dd20c375f8c1efed579154229f5.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thought-provoking message exploring the meaning of life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Striking vertical 2D pixel art maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fantasy world fused with flying airships, biomechanical lifeforms, and mysterious mechanical civilizations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tense, timing-based gameplay focused on evasion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Precision controls with jump strength adjustment, aerial dashes, and rhythmic movement to test your skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple at first, but designed to reveal deeper mechanics the higher you climb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A narrative told through fragmented world-building and mysterious NPC encounters, waiting for you to piece it together</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.poster.avif?t=1754785185\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.webm?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744900/extras/7fcb103ababb683c530d49c8ffd0bac0.mp4?t=1754785185\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A profound journey, unfolding through simple controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel the quiet message the world has to offer\u2014firsthand.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Craving the thrill of a challenging platformer, but tired of endless frustration and failure? This game strips away the stress and leaves only fast-paced, satisfying action! Soar through the air with stylish jumps and dashes, and freely explore a breathtaking world where steampunk meets fantasy!",
